# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the root of the build output and does
# not serve it. Hugo copies static/ verbatim, so this is where it lives.
#
# Posts moved under the year they were written for on 2026-09-26, so that a
# 2026 URL does not have to move when the 2027 class publishes. These keep the
# pre-move paths working for anything that already links to them.
/assignment3     /2026/assignment3/         301
/assignment5     /2026/assignment5/         301
/assignment3/*   /2026/assignment3/:splat   301
/assignment5/*   /2026/assignment5/:splat   301
